Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2}{\fs20\fsp2\fn方正小标宋简体\b1\bord0\blur0\shad0\fad（0，0）\c&H0092EF&}网络爱好者翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Internet Enthusiasts] {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an1}{\fs18\fsp2\fn方正小标宋简体\b1\bord0\blur0\shad0\fad（0，0）\c&H0092EF&}翻译：{\c&HFFFFFF&}danaday z脚步z Ldirene\N{\fnArial\fs30}翻译：{\c&HFFFFFF&}萌菊 Iris_LL Fluxman 陆修
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an1}{\fs18\fsp2\fn方正小标宋简体\b1\bord0\blur0\shad0\fad（0，0）\c&H0092EF&}翻译：{\c&HFFFFFF&} 马丁马丁回音山 一高中萨拉赫\N{\fnArial\fs30}翻译： {\c&HFFFFFF&}不会弹琴的肖邦 kvz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2}{\fs18\fsp2\fn方正小标宋简体\b1\bord0\blur0\shad0\fad（0，0）\c&H0092EF&}翻译：{\c&HFFFFFF&} Franky97 chmso1o 安隅hh zouuoz
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2}{\fs18\fsp2\fn方正小标宋简体\b1\bord0\blur0\shad0\fad（0，0）\c&H0092EF&}后期：{\c&HFFFFFF&}Mike Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们肯定能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah. We got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.56,0:04:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我们在米高梅大酒店 罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}…here at the MGM Grand tonight, Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.84,0:04:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 那时候阿多尼斯 奎迪输给“小帅哥”里基 康兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And, you know, when Adonis Creed lost to "Pretty" Ricky Conlan,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他仍然引起了拳迷及拳手们好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}he was really a curiosity more than anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一场史诗级的对决\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But that was an epic fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.88,0:04:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且从那之后 他连赢了六场比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and since then, he's reeled off six straight wins,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.80,0:04:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚为了得到世界级轻重量级拳击冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and tonight attempts against Danny "The Stuntman" Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.04,0:04:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将和“特技人”丹尼恵勒进行对决\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}to become the heavyweight champion of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.48,0:04:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得一提的是 其实在上次热身赛中中\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It bears mentioning that Creed actually wagered his Mustang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.52,0:04:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪已经输了恵勒一辆野马 罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}before their sparring session, Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且传闻说那辆野马将在今晚再次被作为赌注\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And rumor has it that same Mustang is on the line again tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 大家出去吧 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay, everybody out. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.56,0:05:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 咋样 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Feel good? - Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要记着出右拳 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah. Remember to keep your right hand up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的左右拳都一样厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}His left is just as strong as his right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.72,0:05:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯呐 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Yep. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.35,0:05:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2}{\fs18\fsp2\fn方正兰亭黑简体\b1\bord0\blur0\shad0\fad（0，0）}你大便了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.32,0:05:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 嗯嗯 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Mmm-hmm. - Mmm-hmm. Okay, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是另一场普通的比赛 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's just another fight, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.16,0:05:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 只需要三步就可以走上拳击台\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know, there's only three steps into that ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅仅三步\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just three.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今晚它却像山一样高不可登\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And tonight, it's gonna look as high as a mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.44,0:05:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你跨过围绳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And when you climb through them ropes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.56,0:06:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你便处于孤军奋战的境地\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}it's gonna be the loneliest place in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那你将面对着另一个拳手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}because you're gonna be in there with another fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只想把你击倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}who wants to take you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.48,0:06:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么现在 你扪心自问\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So now, you gotta ask yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚你是想向他人证明自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}are you here to prove something to other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.44,0:06:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是想给自己一个交代\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}or prove something to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.48,0:06:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只求问心无愧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}To myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 换我来问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now, let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,问啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你头发咋回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's with the hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打理了一下 今晚比较特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I combed it. It's a special night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该担心点别的么 小鬼头\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Shouldn't you be thinking about something else, wise guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.96,0:06:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 去证明你自己吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now, you can go prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.36,0:06:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,去把你的野马弄回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now go get your Mustang back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.88,0:06:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,第四节 场上的选手已经完全厮打在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}These guys have really been mixing it up here in the fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.80,0:06:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,比起经验老道的恵勒年轻的奎迪更胜一筹\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So far, Creed's youth outweighing Wheeler's experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:06:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,上呀 冲呀 加油呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let's go! Let's go, baby. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.24,0:07:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 阿多尼斯 奎迪职业生涯中最精彩的比赛也许是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Maybe the most amazing part of Adonis Creed's journey, Roy…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意防守 下盘稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't drop that guard! Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 就是今晚 他为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}…is that tonight, he fights…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.48,0:07:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,出拳 出拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Keep your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.64,0:07:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢得他的教练洛基以及他的父亲阿波罗奎迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}…for the same belt held by both his trainer, Rocky Balboa,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.36,0:07:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,都拿到过的金腰带而进行的这场比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and his father, the great Apollo Creed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.60,0:07:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,恵勒好像终于上线了 我们之前见过这招 罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wheeler seems to be waking up. We've seen this before, Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,恵勒一见血就真的开始发威了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}When Wheeler smells blood, he really turns it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 继续打啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.76,0:07:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油啊 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, D!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.04,0:07:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是三年前的话 奎迪就已经被击倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Three years ago, that's a knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.72,0:07:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但恵勒已经不如从前了 奎迪肯定也感觉到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wheeler's power just isn't the same, and no doubt Creed can sense it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.04,0:07:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你击中他了 别放松 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You got him. Stay on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪胜券在握 现在是在不遗余力的在战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed's on a mission, really pressing the issue now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一记漂亮的左勾拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And a big left hook lands flush!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪继续追击 持续移动着出拳 麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed staying in the pocket, Max. Moving, not running.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:07:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油加油 继续出拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, now! Hands up! Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.48,0:08:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位选手都竭尽全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}These two men are really going at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.80,0:08:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉他 唐尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Tell him, Donnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.84,0:08:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一记左勾拳打的恵勒节节退败\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Another left hook drives Wheeler back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油啊 宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了一记狡猾的上勾拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That was a sneaky little uppercut on the inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.32,0:08:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,恵勒因此受到了重创 罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and Wheeler's hurt by that, Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.96,0:08:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他那颤抖的双腿支撑不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, that wobbled his legs pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.76,0:08:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又是一击重击 - 继续锤他 锤他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Another big shot! - Hold him, hold him, hold him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪让他陷入困境了 麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed has him in trouble, Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.48,0:08:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,恵勒也竭尽所能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wheeler's doing what he can…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.80,0:08:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,恵勒倒下啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wheeler is down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,恵勒倒在台上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wheeler has hit the canvas!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,站那别动 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now stay there, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪教你做人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed taught you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.56,0:08:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧起来把钥匙给我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come and give me my keys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.08,0:08:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来啊 加油啊 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Get up! Come on, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.16,0:08:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来啊 起来呀 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Get up, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恵勒试图爬起来 - 1\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Wheeler, trying to get up. - One!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.56,0:08:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 趴着别动 - 2\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Stay down! - Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他能不能在计时结束前站起来 罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't know if he makes this count, Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.52,0:08:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,3\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.96,0:08:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,4\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.68,0:08:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,5\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.16,0:08:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,6\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.20,0:08:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,7\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.48,0:08:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,8\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.20,0:08:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,9\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.76,0:08:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's it. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.32,0:08:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都结束了 麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And it's over, Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.40,0:08:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪 阿多尼斯 奎迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No way! Adonis Creed…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.76,0:08:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我车钥匙还我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Give me my keys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:08:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为了新的世界轻重量级拳击冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}…is the heavyweight champion of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.24,0:09:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你刚刚做了什么嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know what you just did?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝儿 你知道刚发生了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Baby, you know what just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.52,0:09:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你想起这个孩子的出身\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}When you think of where this kid has come from,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.44,0:09:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对一个拳手来说 那是最不可能开始的起点 罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}the most unlikely beginning for a fighter, Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,像他那样成长\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Growing up the way he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.92,0:09:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,能以这种方式登上拳击之巅\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}to make it to the top of boxing in this way…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.04,0:09:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是前所未有的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's unprecedented!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.40,0:09:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪 奎迪 奎迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed! Creed! Creed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.44,0:09:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为拳王的竞争者是一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's one thing to be the number one contender.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.20,0:09:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为冠军是另一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's a whole other thing to be champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他建立属于自己传奇的第一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is the first step to building a legacy of his own,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.08,0:09:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经迫不及待地想看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and I can hardly wait to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿多尼斯·奎迪的下一步会做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}what's next for Adonis Creed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.80,0:09:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mean, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.68,0:09:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Right? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.68,0:09:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们得赶快\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But we gotta hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她就快要洗完澡出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mean, she's about to get out the shower any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.48,0:10:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐尼 为什么你之前不告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yo, Donnie, why didn't you tell me about this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.92,0:10:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前我不知道我能不能赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I didn't know if I was gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.20,0:10:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那跟这个有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's that got to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.16,0:10:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样 告诉我应该做什么就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look, just tell me what I should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.24,0:10:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得单膝跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You get down on one knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.64,0:10:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在人们还做这种屁事么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}People still do that shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然你也可以直接发条短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You can always send her a text.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,叔叔 我是认真的 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, Unc, I'm being serious, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.36,0:10:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问 你以前是怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mean, what did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.72,0:10:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,对Adrian么 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}To Adrian? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是很久以前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.16,0:10:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一个下雪的冬日 我们在动物园里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We were at the zoo. It was winter. It was snowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.36,0:10:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,周遭一切都很美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Everything smelled fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一只老虎的背上都是雪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There was this tiger. He had snow on its back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.72,0:10:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,它走在我们后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And he's walking in the background.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 我明白了 我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay, I get it. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你说了什么就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just tell me what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正要说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, I was getting to that part.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.56,0:10:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What I said is…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.48,0:10:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问她介不介意嫁给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I asked if she would not mind marrying me very much,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说她是我的全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}which is kind of a dumb way of.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这听起来有点蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}saying she's my world,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还说她让我变得比以前更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and she made me better than I deserved to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.72,0:10:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能理解吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.20,0:10:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你能\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你为何不让你的大脑当机\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Listen, why don't you just turn off your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.52,0:10:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只遵从你的内心去说出来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and let your heart do the talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.04,0:11:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Click.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.48,0:11:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You'll do good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.44,0:11:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,让大脑当机吗 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Turn my brain off? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay. Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.64,0:11:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的 怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}All right. All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}All right, I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.80,0:11:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,叔叔 怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, Unc. Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.48,0:11:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.36,0:11:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 好着呢 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, real good. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.72,0:11:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Great. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.08,0:11:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意嫁给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,B 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Listen, B.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.48,0:12:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经在一起好几年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I know we've been dating for a few years now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.20,0:12:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之间还差了点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and it's just something about us that just click.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.20,0:12:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't know how to explain it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.24,0:12:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当你在我身边的时候我会有一种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but the feeling I get when you're by my side is a feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我不能没有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}that I can't live without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.28,0:12:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这有点疯狂 但是 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I know I sound crazy, but, look,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.68,0:12:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我想说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I guess what I'm trying to say is…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.32,0:12:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意嫁给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.80,0:12:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 我还有点饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm still hungry, babe,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐 你是认真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Are you for real, D?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.48,0:12:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, I'm for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.88,0:12:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别开玩笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, stop playin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.60,0:12:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没在开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I ain't playin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.60,0:12:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才你一句都没听到么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You didn't hear any of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.76,0:12:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没听到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}None of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.84,0:13:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没听到什么 唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}None of what, D?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.88,0:13:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.76,0:13:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你已经知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Nothing that you don't already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.08,0:13:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Remind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才说 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I said that I love you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.96,0:13:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and that I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.20,0:13:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐 你知道你现在在做什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}D, do you know what you're doing right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.84,0:13:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 呃 有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mean, yeah, kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.36,0:13:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点 是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What do you mean, "kind of"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.32,0:13:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Babe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.56,0:13:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了和你真正的在一起 B\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}To keep it real with you, B.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是唯一一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}you're the only person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.32,0:13:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想分享每时每刻的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I wanna share my moments with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.16,0:13:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 Bianca Taylor\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, Bianca Taylor,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.76,0:14:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意嫁给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.16,0:14:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.44,0:14:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哟 是答应的意思吗 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Yo"? Is that a yes? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.44,0:14:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.80,0:14:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.92,0:14:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,维克托\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Viktor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.76,0:15:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的小鬼头看起来很好嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Our boy's looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.32,0:15:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你已经听闻那好消息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm sure you heard the good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.72,0:16:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.84,0:16:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想过回洛杉矶吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You ever thought about going back to LA?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.24,0:16:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你是个费城女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Please, you're a Philly girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.64,0:16:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 应该吧 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, I guess, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.08,0:16:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有更多的空间会更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}it'd be nice to have more space.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.24,0:16:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And your mom's out there…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.40,0:16:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们也贴上标签\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And them labels, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能帮我把我的音乐传播给更多的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Could help me get my music out to more people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.24,0:16:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.04,0:16:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我在费城已经尽自己所能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't know, I feel like I've done everything I could in Philly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.00,0:16:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能理解吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间不站在我这一边 你能理解吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Time ain't exactly on my side, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.00,0:16:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那洛基怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What about Rocky?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.24,0:16:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基有他自己的生活 唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Rocky has his life, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也该开始我们自己的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We gotta start ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天真冷啊 艾德里安 真的冷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's a cold one today, Adrian, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.76,0:17:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好几次想给我们的儿子博比打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I tried calling our son Bobby a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.32,0:17:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是每次他快要接起来的时候我都挂断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But I'd hang up every time he was about to pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 跟你说实话 我不知道该和他说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}because, to tell you the truth, I didn't know what to say to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.00,0:17:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他有了新的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What if he's moving on,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.20,0:17:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这个老东西却要紧追不舍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and I'm like this chunk of yesterday trying to be today?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.36,0:17:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我也融入不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I just don't fit in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.04,0:17:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mean, what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.52,0:18:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,敲敲他家的门 然后说 嘿 最近怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Knock on his door and say, "Hey, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.88,0:18:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年都过的怎么样啊 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's it been, a lot of years?" I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.76,0:18:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从你有了这东西你就一直很兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You've been hype ever since you got this jawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.36,0:19:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.44,0:19:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你脸上的笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That smile right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.72,0:19:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你笑得那么开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You're cheezin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.56,0:19:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我爸唯一留给我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's the only thing my pops left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.40,0:19:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 还有我这双手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mean, that and these hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.32,0:19:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你从来没和我说过 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- You never told me that. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.08,0:19:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这些小秘密是怎么回事 Don\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's up with you and these secrets, Don?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.32,0:19:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近怎么样 挺好 挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How're you doing? All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.88,0:19:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看这个 这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But look at this, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.16,0:19:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- How you doing? - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.48,0:19:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 伊莎贝尔 - 嗨 罗克\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Hey, Isabelle. - Hey, Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我跟你说 有个大个子坐在那儿等你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, listen. Some big guy's sitting over there, waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.08,0:20:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你会知道他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He said you'll know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.92,0:20:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哟 冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yo, champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.44,0:20:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得去打那场比赛 伙计 让那个家伙闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You gotta take that fight, man. Shut this dude up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.76,0:20:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦不 Wheeler还在说那些废话吗 要重赛还太早\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, Wheeler still talking shit? It's a little early for a rematch,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.95,0:20:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.24,0:20:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 开下电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, turn the TV up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.56,0:20:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,悲剧般的过去把他们的人生联系了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}…and the tragic history that connects them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.16,0:20:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.08,0:20:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Nice pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 还行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, they're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.60,0:20:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有我的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No pictures of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.04,0:20:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这里没有那种照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, there's no pictures of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:20:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么在费城\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why are you in Philly?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.72,0:21:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.84,0:21:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌克兰拳击手维克托·德拉戈今日现身费城\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ukrainian boxer Viktor Drago appeared today in Philadelphia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.56,0:21:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,向最近摘冠的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}to issue a very public challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.40,0:21:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,重量级冠军阿多尼斯·奎迪发起公开挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}to recently crowned heavyweight champion Adonis Creed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.92,0:21:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚 拳击赛承办人巴迪·马塞尔召开新闻发布会\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}A press conference was held earlier by boxing promoter Buddy Marcelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.04,0:21:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来到费城是要让你们知道 我们是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We came all the way to Philly to let you know it's serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.20,0:21:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 坐在这里的这个男人 他不是丹尼·惠勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now, this man here, he ain't no Danny Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.44,0:21:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,说句实话 奎迪三年前就应该跟他打的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And let's be honest, Creed fought him three years too late, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.72,0:21:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢得太简单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Easy match.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.36,0:21:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个国家的人喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}People in this country love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.72,0:21:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在俄罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But Russia,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.52,0:21:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人敢惹Drago家的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}no one touch Drago name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.24,0:21:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天晚上一切都变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Everything changed that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.16,0:21:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你知道的 这都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look, you know, that's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.96,0:21:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久很久以前的事情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}a million years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.72,0:21:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说就像是昨天一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Like yesterday to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.76,0:21:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你来是就为了告诉我这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, you came all the way over here to tell me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.00,0:22:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在阿波罗·奎迪 的儿子刚刚获得金腰带后\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's no coincidence that Ivan Drago's son shows up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.08,0:22:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊万·德拉戈的儿子立刻现身 这绝不是巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}right after Apollo Creed's son claims the belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.04,0:22:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是奎迪对德拉戈的对决\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is Creed versus Drago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.20,0:22:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是全世界都想要看到的比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is the fight the whole world wants to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.68,0:22:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是奎迪应该接受的比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And this is the fight he should take.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.08,0:22:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他害怕历史重演\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Unless he's afraid of history repeating itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.96,0:22:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在1985年上演的那场令人震惊的比赛中\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That history being the infamous 1985 match.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.12,0:22:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,拳击传说阿波罗·奎迪 被俄罗斯战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}in which boxing legend Apollo Creed was killed by Russian fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.16,0:22:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊万·德拉戈打死\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ivan Drago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.44,0:22:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波罗的教练洛基·巴尔博亚受到强烈指责\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Apollo's trainer Rocky Balboa was heavily criticized.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.04,0:22:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他没能阻止那场战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}for failing to stop that fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.40,0:22:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}D. Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.60,0:22:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是场炒作\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's a publicity stunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.48,0:22:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.64,0:22:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And let's not forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.88,0:22:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那年晚些时候 巴尔博亚在俄罗斯打败了德拉戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}later that year, Balboa defeated Drago in his own backyard, Russia.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.00,0:22:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你 我失去了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Because of you, I lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.68,0:22:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Country.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.92,0:22:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊重\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.56,0:23:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.72,0:23:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过乌克兰的野狗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You ever see stray dogs in Ukraine?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.40,0:23:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们几天都吃不上饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They go for days with no food.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.36,0:23:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们冲它们吐吐沫 它们什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}People spit on them. They have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.08,0:23:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有家\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有战斗才能生存下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Only will to survive, to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.84,0:23:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I have son.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.88,0:23:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}All he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.48,0:23:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有拳击\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.80,0:23:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子会打败你家那个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}My son will break your boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.68,0:23:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天很累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Been a long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.32,0:23:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想咱们就到此为止吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I think we're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.52,0:23:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为在这儿 我们会把野狗赶出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Because around here we put strays away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.12,0:24:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是张好照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's good picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.40,0:24:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就觉得你会在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I kind of figured you'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.12,0:24:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我一遍一遍给你打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know, I tried calling and calling, but nobody picked up or.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.98,0:24:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没人接\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.40,0:24:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得 刚比完赛就训练有点早吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Kind of early to be training, don't you think, after a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.32,0:24:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是想清醒一下头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just trying to clear my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.72,0:24:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.64,0:24:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这肯定比心理医生便宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Cheaper than a shrink, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.12,0:24:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 唐尼 好吧 我已经听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, Don, come on. I heard what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.88,0:24:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你不能让他们扰乱你的内心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But you can't let them get inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.72,0:25:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解你的心情\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But I know how you're feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.88,0:25:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 你了解吗 - 是的 我了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Oh, do you? - Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.52,0:25:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是很久之前发生的事了 你不要太在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What happened a long time ago, that ain't got nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.60,0:25:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 那场决斗是阿波罗想要的 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Listen, that fight is what Apollo wanted, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.48,0:25:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那本不该发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It shouldn't have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.36,0:25:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.24,0:25:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你要想开\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And you gotta let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.28,0:25:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样折腾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.12,0:25:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你见过他战斗不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You've seen him fight, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.92,0:25:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在体育频道之类的电视节目见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I've seen him on sports TV and stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.04,0:25:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他块头大 但很僵硬\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He's big, but he's raw.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.84,0:25:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不像你 你是一台战斗机器 这是肯定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He ain't no mean machine like you are, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.80,0:25:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.24,0:25:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让你振作起来 因为今天是你的幸运日\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm gonna cheer you up, 'cause today's gonna be your lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.16,0:25:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你而言圣诞节提前来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Christmas just came early for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.12,0:25:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我会为你背黑锅 幸运男\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}'cause I'm gonna hold the bag, lucky guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.24,0:25:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 你才是那个幸运的人 - 这为啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- No, you're the one who's lucky. - How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.20,0:25:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我会让你给我背黑锅\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}'Cause I'm gonna let you hold the bag for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.40,0:25:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这样更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's it. That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.84,0:26:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪被爆揍 这场比赛很快会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed taking major hits. This could be over soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.28,0:26:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪倒下啦 他可能伤的有些重\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed is down! And he could be badly hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.72,0:26:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波罗在台阶上无情地看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Apollo on the floor looking unresponsive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.76,0:26:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.64,0:26:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他彻底不动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There is no movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.52,0:27:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的眼睛闪闪发光 我还年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ Glitter in my eyes And I was young ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.64,0:27:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我清楚离家出走他们会怎样议论\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ Know what they say I ran away from home ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.16,0:27:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 我认清了这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ I thank you I learned the world ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.44,0:27:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人认为我是个心碎的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ They think I'm a broken girl ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.52,0:27:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我爱上了失落\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ I think I'm in love with lost ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.68,0:27:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好听\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Amazing voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.48,0:27:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心碎了 但至少被唤醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ My heart cracked But at least it's touched ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.12,0:27:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于演出我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Sorry for the theatrics.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.68,0:27:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但人们喜欢精彩的表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But people like a good show.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.68,0:27:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 你那种举动很卑鄙\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That was a grimy move, brah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.32,0:27:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是有意那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ain't nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.08,0:27:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不为拳击项目而自豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Can't say I'm proud of what our sport's become,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.84,0:27:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那就是这个项目的本质\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but that's the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.12,0:27:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Call it whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.96,0:27:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说你就是为了钱才这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Sounds to me like you just trying to get paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.48,0:27:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱可是有负面影响的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The money is a side effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.12,0:27:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马不可能自己建成\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"The Rumble in the Jungle" didn't just manifest itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.44,0:27:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须有人去做这件事让它发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Somebody had to make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.36,0:27:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然它会存在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Will it into existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.00,0:27:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵 那个人就应该是你 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, yeah, that's supposed to be you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.44,0:28:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还看到别人站在这关心你嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You see anybody else standing here with a care in their heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.28,0:28:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你目的是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I want the same thing you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.92,0:28:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说说看是啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.88,0:28:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在拳击的历史中\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}In the history of boxing,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.12,0:28:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共有77个重量级冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}there have been 77 heavyweight champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.12,0:28:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.60,0:28:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你觉得老百姓知道多少个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But how many do you think they know?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.68,0:28:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,四个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Four?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.40,0:28:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,五个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Five?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.40,0:28:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,光有金腰带可不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The belt ain't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.84,0:28:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要一个故事 才能让你永垂不朽\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You need a narrative. Something that sticks to the ribs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.48,0:28:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸他懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your dad, he knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.92,0:28:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮自己一个忙 哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do yourself a favor, brah,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.64,0:28:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想着劝服我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and quit while you ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.88,0:28:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,自我保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Self-preservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.24,0:28:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少你这点比你爹做的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}At least you got that over your old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.96,0:28:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑子里肯定都是洛基的鬼话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That must be Rocky whispering in your ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.32,0:29:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.48,0:29:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好听\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Amazing voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.72,0:29:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}For real though, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.80,0:29:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 菲尔摩尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}thank you, Fillmore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.32,0:29:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近怎么样孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How you doing, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.84,0:29:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We gotta talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.00,0:29:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,边散步边聊顺便透透气\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let's take a walk and get some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.20,0:29:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 房子里有些闷\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay? Kind of stuffy in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.28,0:29:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那盏灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look at that light.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.24,0:29:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意儿坏了好几年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That thing's been broken for a couple of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.20,0:29:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄得我强迫症犯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's driving me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.16,0:29:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远指望不上有人来修\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}City won't fix it or nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.92,0:29:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯亮着多好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What good is a light.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.00,0:29:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那不亮 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}that don't light, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.12,0:29:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思 但那也一样蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Kind of funny, but it's stupid, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.84,0:29:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要出趟远门\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I gotta take the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.16,0:30:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.92,0:30:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人杀了我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}These dudes killed my pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.92,0:30:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他们到处瞎逛 净说瞎话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now they're parading around, talking shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.52,0:30:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让他们继续下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I can't let that slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.32,0:30:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是冠军对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm the champ, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.28,0:30:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.88,0:30:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我没得选\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So I ain't got a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.36,0:30:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.00,0:30:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸也说过同样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's the same thing your father said,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.20,0:30:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他死在那里 我就抱着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and he died right here, in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.20,0:30:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他的选择让你妈遭受了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look what his choice put your mother through.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.76,0:30:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想让这再发生一遍 对吧 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You don't wanna really bring all that stuff up again, do you, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.48,0:30:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你会懂我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I thought you would get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.20,0:30:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不去 我会永远活在羞辱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}If I don't take this fight, I gotta live with it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.44,0:30:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人是被仇恨养大的 你懂我意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That kid was raised in hate, you know what I'm talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.12,0:30:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不一样 所以别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You weren't. Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.00,0:30:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但你做了 - 那不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- But you did. - It's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.56,0:30:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么不一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It was different?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.96,0:30:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,大不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's a lot different.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.16,0:30:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚应该是我和德拉戈在擂台上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I was supposed to be in there with Drago that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.88,0:30:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and not your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.00,0:30:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本可以停止比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And I could've thrown in the towel,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.56,0:30:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.56,0:30:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那带给我的愧疚将会伴我终生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And I gotta live with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.80,0:30:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来我再进入赛场\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And when I did get in that ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.04,0:31:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙毁了我的信念\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}that guy broke things in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.04,0:31:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不能再恢复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}that ain't never been fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.03,0:31:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做不值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.20,0:31:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不值\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.96,0:31:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要和他打\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why do you wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.36,0:31:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么呢 我刚告诉过你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What are you talking about? I just told you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.00,0:31:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你没有 唐尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, you didn't, Donnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.56,0:31:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要和他打\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why do you wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.56,0:31:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他们为什么要和你打\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I get why they wanna fight you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.05,0:31:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他们在为什么而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I know what they're fighting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.64,0:31:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.12,0:31:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 你什么都输不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Listen to me, you got everything to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.72,0:31:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他没有什么可输的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He's got nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.24,0:31:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,当一个拳手没什么可输的时候 是很可怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}When a fighter ain't got nothing to lose, he's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.68,0:31:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.88,0:31:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我会输\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You think I'm gonna lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.64,0:31:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.76,0:31:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也说过他经验不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Same guy that said he ain't have enough experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.80,0:31:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不成熟 对吧 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Raw, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.52,0:31:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你觉得我打不过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But you don't think I could beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.36,0:31:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你想说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Is that what you're trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.76,0:32:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没有这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, that's not what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.91,0:32:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我不能永远都在你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm saying I'm not gonna be here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.20,0:32:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And what's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.52,0:32:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思就是你要放聪明点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That means you gotta do some smart thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.64,0:32:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我是在犯傻吗 Rock\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, you wanna talk about smart decisions, Rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.76,0:32:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人住在这房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You in this house all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.76,0:32:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁在照顾你 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Who been taking care of you? Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.64,0:32:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我一直陪着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I've been here for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.52,0:32:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁这样对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Who else you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.60,0:32:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.56,0:32:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你支不支持 我都要参加比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm taking this fight with or without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.88,0:32:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会支持你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's gotta be without.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.48,0:32:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.20,0:32:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.64,0:32:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这样丢下我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You walkin' out on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.36,0:32:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少这次你不用担心要不要认输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}At least you ain't gotta worry about throwing in the towel this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.04,0:33:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.52,0:33:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}D, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.28,0:33:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基那家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Rocky, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.92,0:33:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Rocky what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.28,0:33:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不想帮我备战了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He ain't training me for the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.56,0:33:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你要接受挑战了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait, you're taking the fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.36,0:33:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起经历那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}All the shit that we've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.04,0:33:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这会儿把我丢下了 真是混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He gonna leave me high and dry. That's bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.76,0:33:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得癌症的时候是我照顾他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I took care of him when he had cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.60,0:33:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然他早死了 B\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He could've been dead, B.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.15,0:33:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信他有他的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm sure he has his reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.84,0:33:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 什么理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, yeah? Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.32,0:33:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.88,0:34:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没他也行\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.68,0:34:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.52,0:35:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.88,0:35:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想把那个房间留一小部分作工作室\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I want just a little piece of that room for a studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.56,0:35:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以 你说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That works. It's all you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.76,0:35:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.48,0:35:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 也许只是坐飞机有点累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't know. Maybe I'm just a little tired from the flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.64,0:35:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.72,0:35:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就别出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We don't have to go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.96,0:35:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆在家里 点些东西吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We can just stay in, order some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.68,0:35:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 宝贝 你得去告诉你妈妈一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hmm. No, baby, you have to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.92,0:35:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的歌唱得怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, how's the music?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.68,0:35:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Donnie没告诉你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, Donnie didn't tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.08,0:35:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}D?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.00,0:35:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Uh… I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.92,0:35:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我签约了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh. Yeah, I signed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.92,0:35:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.12,0:35:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 公司也开始筹备给我发唱片了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, it's great. The record label really hit the ground running, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.76,0:35:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年夏天我要去参加音乐节\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm up for festivals this summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.60,0:35:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恭喜你 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Congratulations. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.76,0:36:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rocky怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, how's Rocky?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.24,0:36:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不想过来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He didn't wanna make the trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.72,0:36:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 你知道他就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Nah, Ma, you know how he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.08,0:36:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不爱出远门\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}with the traveling.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.92,0:36:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay, Ma.
