Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.56,0:42:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须和他打\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I gotta be.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.24,0:42:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不愿意帮我没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But if you ain't gonna do it for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.36,0:42:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得为他们做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}at least do it for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.40,0:43:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好考虑一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.96,0:43:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,替他们完成遗愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Beat what they couldn't beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.41,0:43:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,为他们正名\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Change the way they were remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.40,0:43:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们改写历史的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is our chance to rewrite history.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.00,0:43:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Our history.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.80,0:43:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的战绩或许平平无奇 但是相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}His record might be light, but, believe me,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.80,0:43:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很难对付\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}he ain't no undercard.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.16,0:43:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你一定得照我说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, you gotta be with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.20,0:43:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,任你吩咐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.84,0:43:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.00,0:44:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Creed对战Drago\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed versus Drago.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.16,0:44:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可相当有份量\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That means something.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.28,0:44:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你决定应战是因为父辈那件事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did that factor into your decision to take this fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.36,0:44:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,说奎迪就不得不提德拉戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mean, you can't say Creed without Drago, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.72,0:44:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们想看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is what y'all want.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.16,0:44:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都想看我们打\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's what everyone wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.28,0:44:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有件事很难让人不去注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Also, can't help but to notice,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.28,0:44:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是这场比赛某人不再是你的教练了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}who won't be in your corner this time around.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.48,0:44:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基在享受天伦之乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Rocky's taking some family time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.28,0:44:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有杜克帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But Duke's got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.52,0:44:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的父亲教给了我父亲他的毕生所学\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}His father taught my father everything he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.72,0:44:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,速度 唐 只有这样才能打败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Speed, D. That's how we gonna beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.72,0:44:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,技巧 速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Technique, speed…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.12,0:45:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信他肯定会帮我做好准备迎战\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm confident he'll have me ready for this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.92,0:45:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你知道了你父亲和德拉戈之间发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And knowing what happened between your father and Drago,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.48,0:45:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定会有所顾虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}you must have some worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.76,0:45:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好怕的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What would I be afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.44,0:45:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不正是我作为一个拳击手所要做的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm a fighter. This is what I do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.08,0:45:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Who the champ?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.56,0:45:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.12,0:45:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Looking good!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.12,0:45:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Creed Creed Creed\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed! Creed! Creed!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.16,0:46:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比你爸还娇小\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You're much smaller than your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.92,0:46:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准提我老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't you talk about my pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.32,0:46:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿兄弟 我们在这也能打\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, we could do this right here, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.72,0:46:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到这来 - 唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Step up here! - D!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.84,0:46:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他帮不了你什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He can't help you no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.20,0:46:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到我说的了吗 在场外他可帮不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You hear me? He can't help behind that ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.92,0:46:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻愣在那 小嘴一张就知道说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You stand there. All you're doing is talking, homie.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.84,0:46:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸也得看你挨揍 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your pops can't protect you, you feel me?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.80,0:46:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许说我爸 有本事别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't talk about my father! Don't turn your back on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.44,0:46:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可在我的地盘上 老哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You in my house, homie!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.60,0:46:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保有人拦着他们 我们在更衣室\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Make sure they hold them down. We're in the dressing room.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.96,0:47:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是Jim Lampley和Roy Jones为您主持\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Jim Lampley here, along with Roy Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.04,0:47:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚的主赛事马上就要开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We're moments away from tonight's main event.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.40,0:47:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jim 我这辈子也没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Jim, I would have never thought in a million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.04,0:47:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能以另一种方式见证奎迪和德拉戈的对战\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'd witness another Creed versus Drago fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.00,0:47:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好准备吧 罗伊·德拉戈正在朝拳击场走来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, get ready, Roy. Drago makes his way to the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.96,0:47:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的父亲领着他穿过愤懑的观众\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}His father leads the way through the hostile crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.40,0:47:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能感觉到那股能量 奎迪 肯定也能\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You can feel the energy. I'm sure Creed does.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.64,0:47:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他那一角有无数粉丝为他助威\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He has a big advantage with the fans in his corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.16,0:47:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持专注 这是你的主场 宝贝儿 专注才是要诀\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Stay focused. You're at home, baby. Focus is the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.76,0:47:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑到德拉戈的体型和拳路\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Given Drago's size and style,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.92,0:47:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也许会考虑用力量来应对奎迪的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}he'll look to use his power to counter Creed's speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.04,0:47:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了我们为什么要打这场\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Remember why we're here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.60,0:47:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm the champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.32,0:48:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿多尼斯·奎迪隆重登场\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Adonis Creed making a grand entrance tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.40,0:48:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪和他的父亲一样 总是那么吸睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Like his father, Creed is ever the showman,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.20,0:48:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能让观众热血沸腾\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and is energizing the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.60,0:49:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈这下知道了 这可是奎迪的主场\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed is letting Drago know exactly who this arena belongs to.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.40,0:49:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也太像莎士比亚的剧本了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It all feels so Shakespearean.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.96,0:49:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,成长在世界两端的孩子 却因一场悲剧站上拳击场 多么残酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Two sons, raised a world apart, yet inexorably linked by tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.28,0:49:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now, gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.72,0:49:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在更衣室里介绍过规则了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I went over the rules in the dressing room.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.92,0:49:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,请务必确保比赛全程文明公正\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I wanna caution you to keep this fight clean at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.08,0:49:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及记得自我保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Protect yourself at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.00,0:49:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,规则如上 不得违逆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And what I say, you must obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.24,0:49:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们好运 互击拳套\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Good luck. Touch gloves.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.72,0:49:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,互击拳套\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Touch gloves.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.96,0:49:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪 这次上阵没了长久以来的教练洛基·巴尔博亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed fights without longtime trainer Rocky Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.88,0:49:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣的是 两位拳击手积怨已久\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Interesting to see how Duke manages the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.24,0:49:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,而杜克要如何在场角辅助呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}with so much bad blood between the fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.16,0:49:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.52,0:49:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得他能直接把你当场打死\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He think he gonna run straight through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.36,0:49:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给他点厉害瞧瞧 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- You show him what's up. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.72,0:49:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的主场 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is your house, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.84,0:49:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是我的主场 - 上吧 宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- It's my house. - Let's go, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.32,0:50:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Box!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.84,0:50:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在比赛开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And we're underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.64,0:50:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果只看体型\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}If all goes according to form,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.36,0:50:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪应该是个更迅捷更全能的选手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed is seen as the more versatile boxer, quicker…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.96,0:50:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 宝贝儿 就那样出拳 保持状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, baby, throw that jab! Let it rip!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.28,0:50:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈试图打出一记重拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Drago is trying to land something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.76,0:50:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,戳 戳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Dig, dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.16,0:50:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,往下攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.60,0:50:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪展开了一系列身体击打\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed connects with a couple of body shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.40,0:50:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后一个右拳打在脸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And a right hand upstairs for Creed.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.92,0:50:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈暂时还没有一次有效出拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Drago hasn't thrown a meaningful punch yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.48,0:50:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪又一记右拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And another right hand for Creed.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.84,0:50:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪挡住了那一拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed blocked that punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.28,0:50:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是被打退到了圈绳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and still it knocked him back into the ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.64,0:50:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, we good.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.76,0:50:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 奎迪似乎有点吃不消那重拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed doesn't like that, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.96,0:50:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,可别犯蠢 年轻人 他在引诱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't be stupid, kid. He's baiting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.04,0:50:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪将对手逼退 愤怒地打出了一连串拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed pressing now, angrily rushes forward with a volley of punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.76,0:50:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在诱你深入\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He's pulling you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.20,0:50:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈一记大力的左勾拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}A huge left hook by Drago!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.64,0:50:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加把劲啊小子 - 奎迪有些踉跄\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Come on, kid. - Creed shaken up by that punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.20,0:51:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,清醒一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Clear your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.28,0:51:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪占据了赛场中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed commands the center of the ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.68,0:51:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是被对手狠狠打在肋骨上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but there's a hard body shot to the ribs.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.68,0:51:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,右侧肋骨也受到了重击\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And another one on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.04,0:51:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了 兄弟 振作点 唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What you doing, baby? What you doing, D?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.88,0:51:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈右勾拳狠狠击中奎迪头部\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And a right hand by Drago that knocks Creed's head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.12,0:51:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪能感觉到那些拳头力量可不小\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed can feel the power behind those punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.32,0:51:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在德拉戈开始了进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And now Drago is on the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.24,0:51:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,出拳 出拳 出拳 举起拳头 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Jab out, jab out, jab out. Hands up, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.88,0:51:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈正沿圈绳遛着对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Drago's stalking him along the ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.84,0:51:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,离圈绳远点 唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Get off the ropes, D!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.04,0:51:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别呆在角上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Out the corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.88,0:51:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 唐 离开角落 快离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, D! Out the corner, out the corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.44,0:51:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈右拳猛击直接把奎迪打懵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hard right hand by Drago, and Creed is shaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.64,0:51:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好第一轮告一段落\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}as the first round comes to a close.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.32,0:51:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,电视机前的观众可能也没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I think most watching at home are a little surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.92,0:51:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,才短短开场的几分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}by how impressive Viktor Drago has looked.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.40,0:51:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,维克多·德拉戈已经看起来如此强劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}in these opening minutes of the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.40,0:51:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑到选手们的新仇旧怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}With the history these men share,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.84,0:51:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜克应该是花了大把的功夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Duke may have his hands full keeping Creed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.80,0:51:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助奎迪不受情绪干扰以达到巅峰状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}from letting his emotions get the best of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.24,0:51:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况 唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What you doing, D?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.60,0:51:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得按照咱们的计划来 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- You need to stick with the game plan. - I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.52,0:52:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,调整步伐 注意你的角度 你没有考虑你的角度\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Stay off the line. Take your angles. You ain't taking your angles.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.20,0:52:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.36,0:52:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他给你一个左钩拳…没事 兄弟 保持镇定\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}If he throws you a left hook… Come on, man, hold the phone on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.08,0:52:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你以为我不知道这么做吗 - 是吗 如果你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- You think I don't know that shit? - Well, if you know it,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.00,0:52:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,去这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.17,0:52:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（190.3，246.7）}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.88,0:52:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（190.3，242.7）}那么告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.50,0:52:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（195.3，241.9）}为什么他还站在那
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.04,0:52:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（191.4，247.5）}他害怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.63,0:52:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（191.4，240.3）}打倒他
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.36,0:52:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我们要开始第二回合了 观众们还在呼喊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And now, as we prepare for round two, this crowd is still buzzing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.80,0:52:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在第一节最后一分钟 德拉戈打出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}from the vicious rally that Drago brought forth in the last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.12,0:52:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,强势一波攻势\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}of round number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.00,0:52:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,打的聪明点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come out smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.36,0:52:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当回合接近尾声时 奎迪陷入了前所未有的困境\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Got Creed in serious trouble as the round came to a close.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.20,0:52:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Box!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.28,0:52:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 第二回合开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And now, round two begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.32,0:52:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈出击了 没浪费一点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And Drago comes out throwing, wasting no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.84,0:52:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离边界远点 - 奎迪被打到后退了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Get off the ropes! - And Creed is backed.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.20,0:52:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在边界附近 奎迪试图避免这些强力的拳头\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}into the ropes, trying to avoid those power shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.00,0:52:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.16,0:53:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,场面急转直下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Things just got ugly fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.00,0:53:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一次右手的强力击打 奎迪现在有大麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And another hard right hand shot, and Creed is in big trouble now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.00,0:53:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持移动 唐尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Keep moving, Donnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.16,0:53:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪被一记右勾拳打的有点晕\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}A massive right hand sends Creed reeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.00,0:53:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他试图重新保持步伐平稳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He tries to regain his footing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.00,0:53:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪试图还以颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed trying to answer back.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.68,0:53:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在一记强力勾拳直接把奎迪打到了边界\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And now a huge hook sends Creed flying through the ropes!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.72,0:53:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.08,0:53:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.36,0:53:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.52,0:53:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.72,0:53:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,五 六\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Five! Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.80,0:53:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's it, that's it, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.12,0:53:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪 奎迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed! Creed!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.28,0:53:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.76,0:53:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Box!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.88,0:53:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪需要拿出一些绝活\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed needs something.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.96,0:53:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要扭转这场比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}to try to turn this fight around.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.85,0:53:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（192，242.7）}把他打出去
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.56,0:53:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈一直保持进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Drago just keeps coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.28,0:53:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是一记直奔肋骨的重拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What a big rib shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.56,0:53:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.72,0:53:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两记强力的右勾拳直奔肋骨去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Those were two tremendous right hands to the rib cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.72,0:54:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以听到靠近擂台旁边人的呼喊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You could've heard that one in the nosebleed seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.84,0:54:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪很清楚受伤位置 所以他用另一种方式站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed clearly in pain, as he finds a way to his feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.00,0:54:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还没有放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Not ready to give up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.48,0:54:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 这越来越危险了 吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't know. This is getting dangerous, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.00,0:54:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 上我这来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay! Come to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.12,0:54:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 贝勒斯尝试让他继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And now, Bayless is gonna let him go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.08,0:54:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.68,0:54:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Box!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.36,0:54:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他立马移动到另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He comes barreling out of the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.68,0:54:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一记凶狠的右勾拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Huge right hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.32,0:54:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈试图结束这场比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Drago trying to end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.96,0:54:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪在铃响之前打出一记右拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And Creed delivers a big right hand at the bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.60,0:54:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去 回到你的角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Get back! Get back to your corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.84,0:54:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝勒斯警告了德拉戈 他看起来很沮丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Bayless restraining Drago, seemingly frustrated…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.28,0:54:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,服从我的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Obey my commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.36,0:54:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,…因为他快要结束这场比赛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}…as he was close to finishing the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.44,0:54:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得给我拿出点绝活 如果没有 我就要终止这场比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You got to show me something. If not, I'm gonna stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.52,0:54:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还能打吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Can you fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.64,0:54:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我很好 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, I'm good, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.60,0:54:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要叫停比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hell no. I'm calling this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.00,0:54:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 别叫停比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Nigga, don't call this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.24,0:54:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有必要向别人证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You ain't got to prove shit to nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.16,0:55:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你 你的肋骨好像断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look at you. Your ribs look like they broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.36,0:55:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能叫停比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You can't call this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.30,0:55:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2}{\fs18\fsp2\fn方正兰亭黑简体\b1\bord0\blur0\shad0\fad（0，0）}他在影响你
