Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.60,0:55:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2}{\fs18\fsp2\fn方正兰亭黑简体\b1\bord0\blur0\shad0\fad（0，0）}这就是为什么她离开我们
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.81,0:55:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2}{\fs18\fsp2\fn方正兰亭黑简体\b1\bord0\blur0\shad0\fad（0，0）}懂了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.00,0:55:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的牙套给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hand me my mouthpiece.
