Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.16,0:55:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.84,0:55:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我们进入第三节\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now, as we go to round three,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.60,0:55:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿多尼斯奎迪已经被打的出血\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Adonis Creed has been beaten up and bloodied.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.36,0:55:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,由雪崩般的强力重拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}by an avalanche of power shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.76,0:55:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,由维克多德拉戈在前两节打出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}from Viktor Drago in the first two rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.16,0:55:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来看看阿多尼斯奎迪还能挺多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And we'll see how much Adonis Creed has left now,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.92,0:55:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他试图继续支撑比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}as he tries to stay alive in the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.40,0:55:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Stop the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.12,0:56:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈打出极具危险的连环拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Dangerous swings from Drago.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.84,0:56:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,而克里德拼命地想阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}as Creed desperately tries to hold him off.
