Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.88,0:56:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快结束比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, stop the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.00,0:56:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈又打出一记拳 克里德似乎躲开了他的进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And another shot by Drago! Creed seemingly on his last legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.96,0:56:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 德拉戈继续发动攻势 - 加油 小迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Drago on the attack. - Come on, D!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.32,0:56:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 又是对肋骨的致命一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, and with a devastating shot to the rib cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.88,0:56:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.60,0:57:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个明显的犯规 又或者比赛已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is an obvious disqualification, or so it would appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.24,0:57:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为奎迪已经完全倒下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}because Creed was fully down.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.20,0:57:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在德拉戈打出那记长拳的那一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}at the moment that Drago landed that last shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.32,0:57:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 你是要杀了其他人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- No! - You wanna kill somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.92,0:57:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不可能 宝贝 不 - 放轻松 放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- No way, baby. No! - Easy, easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.44,0:57:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不 - 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- No. No, no, no! - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.08,0:57:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 - 冷静一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No! Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.32,0:57:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在比赛场地完全安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This arena is completely silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.60,0:57:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,观众都等待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}as the audience waits to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.12,0:57:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻的阿多尼斯奎迪的状况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}what will be the condition of young Adonis Creed.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.36,0:58:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,眶骨骨折 肋骨骨折 3级脑震荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Cracked orbital bone, two cracked ribs, grade-3 concussion,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.68,0:58:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,肾破裂 多处挫伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}ruptured kidney, numerous contusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.40,0:58:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.56,0:58:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,肾破裂 那是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}A ruptured kidney, is that…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.96,0:58:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的伤需要休息和时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}His injuries will heal with rest and time,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.80,0:58:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括肾脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}including the kidney.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.76,0:58:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我们不应该只采取手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now, we shouldn't have to resort to surgery,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.32,0:58:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们需要把他留在这里至少48小时 作为\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but we will need to keep him here for at least 48 hours, as a.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.76,0:58:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,保险措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}precaution.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.40,0:58:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他感觉不到疼痛因为注射了吗啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now he's still numb from the morphine.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.78,0:58:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但过后肯定会有感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but he'll certainly feel it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.80,0:58:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Okay. - You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.04,0:58:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我就是去坐坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Fine, I just gotta sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.72,0:58:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你期望…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}If you're expecting…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.40,0:58:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.48,0:58:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 说真的 放轻松 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, no, seriously. Take it easy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.60,0:58:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下 尤厄尔医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Excuse me, Dr. Ewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.36,0:58:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来拜访你 这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You have a visitor. Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.48,0:58:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,比安卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Bianca.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.76,0:58:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我很难过事情变得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Listen, I'm so sorry everything went…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.84,0:58:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不该出现在这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I should've been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.36,0:58:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.24,0:59:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.68,0:59:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.88,0:59:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以去看看他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Is it okay if I see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.52,0:59:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我们来说有什么关系呢 我们是有目共睹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What difference do it make to us? We saw what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.84,0:59:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们尽了本职工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They doing what they supposed to be doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.36,0:59:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.52,0:59:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.64,0:59:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.24,0:59:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,WBC对裁判的决定没有表示出异议\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}WBC's not gonna contest the referee's decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.48,0:59:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以维克托还是没有参赛资格\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}so Viktor remains disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.88,0:59:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Bottom line,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.40,0:59:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,冠军依旧属于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}you still the champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.28,0:59:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你休息一会儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm gonna let you rest, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.20,0:59:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你需要什么 我就在门外\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, if you need something, you know, I'm outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.44,0:59:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,多尼 有人来陪你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Got some company, D.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.28,1:00:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You did good.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.24,1:00:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We tried.
