Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.72,1:00:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去决心满满 我是说 这毋庸置疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You showed a ton of heart. I mean, there's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.16,1:00:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 决心满满 - 决心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Showed a ton of heart. - Heart?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.84,1:00:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我特么真的在努力不让自己听见这词\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Man, I ain't trying to hear that shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.52,1:00:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,多尼 你不能对罗克如此无礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}D. It's Rock.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.04,1:00:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 没事 没什么大不了的 - 不 你们俩不应该这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Oh, it's okay. It's all right. - No, you guys gotta work it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.76,1:00:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛还没开始就意味着我输了 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I lost the fight before it even started, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.52,1:00:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.92,1:00:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙 这大家伙块头不小\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This guy was… He's a big guy, he's strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.68,1:00:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他完全够得到你 他各种…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He got the reach on you. He got all kinds of…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.52,1:01:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 现在你倒想着训练我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, now you're trying to train me?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.40,1:01:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,想着做我教练吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Be my coach?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.52,1:01:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你看看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.32,1:01:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我现在什么样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.60,1:01:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在这里做什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What are you still doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.88,1:01:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这捡我的碎骨吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Here to pick up the pieces?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.92,1:01:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.32,1:01:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该在费城的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Shouldn't you be in Philly?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.80,1:01:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿多尼斯 - 没事 让他说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Adonis. - No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.96,1:01:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想他把所有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't want him to get all…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.56,1:01:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们各自保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Take care of each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.64,1:01:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.40,1:01:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,多尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.56,1:02:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是爱你的 多尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He loves you, D.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.84,1:02:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.56,1:02:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在看你呢 多尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm looking right at you, babe.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.64,1:02:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是怎么看我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How's that baby gonna look at me?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.40,1:03:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿多尼斯 你真的有冠军的感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Adonis, do you really feel like a champ?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.64,1:03:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得自己够格吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do you think you deserve to keep the belt?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.84,1:03:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿多尼斯 你为什么会接受那场挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why would you take that fight, Adonis?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.32,1:03:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了阿多尼斯·奎迪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Is this it for Adonis Creed?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.20,1:03:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 我自己可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm cool. I'm cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.20,1:03:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多尼 让我帮你吧 多尼 - 我说了我自己能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- D, please, let me help you, baby. - I said I can walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.40,1:03:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来 坐下… - 我说了我自己能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Please sit… - I said I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.92,1:04:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 之后 这一切就像…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't know. Lately, it's like…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.20,1:04:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经不再是那个多尼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He hasn't really been himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.00,1:04:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And I get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.12,1:04:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他正处于水深火热之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}'Cause he's going through a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.60,1:04:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也是才开始进行物理治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He's just starting physical therapy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.80,1:04:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让他自己回到正轨上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Trying to get himself right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.60,1:04:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.20,1:04:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}he's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.48,1:04:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分冷淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}distant.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.04,1:05:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不与他人他物有所联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and disconnected.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.56,1:05:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就好像一切对于他来说都不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's like nothing really matters to him right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.92,1:05:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Including me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.52,1:05:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是他的新变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Which is new.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.88,1:05:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.40,1:05:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你要陪伴在他身旁 照顾好他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Listen, be there for him, take care of him,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.52,1:05:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的爱奉献给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}give him your love.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.92,1:05:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 你也要意识到 他现在所处的境况\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But also, you gotta realize he's in a place right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.80,1:05:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有靠他自救\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}that only he can get himself out of.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.88,1:05:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在所经历的一切…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And with everything he's going through…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.44,1:05:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在所经历的一切吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}With everything he's going through?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.88,1:05:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经涉足于他生活的方方面面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You've been in his corner every step of the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.32,1:05:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个成年人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He's a grown man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.40,1:05:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会痊愈的 由内而外\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He's gotta heal from the inside out.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.12,1:05:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我知道的 我已经身处于那儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Trust me, I know. I've been there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.64,1:05:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.16,1:06:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,能感觉到她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Feel her?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.00,1:06:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,能\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.24,1:06:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 德拉戈让非议者缄默 最精彩的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Highlights of Drago silencing critics tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.92,1:06:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在激烈的第一回合就淘汰了安东尼·诺瓦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}with a devastating first round knockout of Anthony Novak.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.76,1:06:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是对麦克斯·凯勒曼进行的赛后采访\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Here's a post-fight interview with Max Kellerman.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.32,1:06:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,维克托 你当时被阿多尼斯·奎迪击败 颇具非议\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Viktor, here we are just months since your controversial loss to.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.38,1:06:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,数月后 我们又站在了这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Adonis Creed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.08,1:06:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次胜利给你的感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How does this win feel?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.88,1:06:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁击败我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What loss?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.60,1:06:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,补充一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.88,1:06:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你因为阿多尼斯·奎迪取消参赛资格\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}From your disqualification to Adonis Creed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.56,1:07:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是今晚 你对此的感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But how does this feel to you tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.24,1:07:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没啥感觉 但奎迪必须要和我一战\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't care. Creed must fight me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.20,1:07:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果他不想要和你打呢 - 那他就不是冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- And if he doesn't fight you? - Then he's no champion.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.48,1:07:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿多尼斯 你听着 又有公开挑战了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There you have it, Adonis. Challenge is on the table.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.28,1:09:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,维克托\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Viktor!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.08,1:10:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's good?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.40,1:10:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是勉强维持生计 伙计 好久不见了 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just maintaining, man. Long time no see, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.16,1:10:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 伙计 刚刚被抓到 你知道的 关于房子孩子的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Nothing, man. Just been caught up. You know, the house, the baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.56,1:10:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是这么一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know how it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.72,1:10:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 比安卡怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah? How Bianca doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.84,1:10:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很好 她很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She's good. She's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.72,1:10:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Good, good, good.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.84,1:10:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 伙计 我一直想和你打一局\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Listen, man, I've been meaning to hit you up, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.40,1:10:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,领队想知道我们下一步要和谁打\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Commissioner wanna know who we plan to fight next.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.20,1:10:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必和德拉戈打\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You ain't gotta fight Drago,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.28,1:10:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你必须和某人战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but you gotta fight someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.00,1:10:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得保卫腰带\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You gotta defend the belt.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.68,1:10:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则 它就会空出\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Otherwise, it's gonna be vacated.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.28,1:10:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以设置一些 你知道类似调整战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I could set up a little, you know, tuneup fight, kind of.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.36,1:10:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你知道吗 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No. You know what, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.48,1:10:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在别担心这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't worry about none of that right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.68,1:11:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Listen, just come on inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.44,1:11:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,打沙包 伙计 热热身\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hit the bag, man, warm up.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.44,1:11:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.88,1:11:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我去拿我的东西 然后在那里见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, I'm gonna grab my stuff, and I'm gonna meet you in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.68,1:11:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}All right, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.44,1:11:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的身体力量放在那个手套上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Put your body weight into that glove.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.36,1:11:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 用力打它\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There you go. Lean in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.92,1:11:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我给你打过无数次电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, I called you, like, a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.80,1:11:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 关于灯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, it's about the light.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.72,1:11:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,能用多长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How long?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.96,1:11:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想具体点吗 几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You want to be specific? Couple years.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.52,1:11:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.76,1:11:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 装一个灯泡需要多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mean, how many guys does it take to screw in a light bulb?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.56,1:11:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm not joking.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.76,1:12:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能给你们回个电话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Can I call you guys back?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.80,1:12:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.60,1:12:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.88,1:12:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ma.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.72,1:13:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.68,1:13:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近怎么样 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How you doing, kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.84,1:13:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.32,1:13:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I hope you don't mind,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.68,1:13:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈问我能不能出来 因为她很担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}your mom asked if I would come out 'cause she's worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.28,1:13:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I am, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.44,1:13:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.40,1:13:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必大老远过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You didn't have to come all this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.04,1:13:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坐火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}By train.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.04,1:13:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐火车三天\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Three days on a train.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.76,1:13:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 你知道 给你时间思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's all right, you know, gives you time to think.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.20,1:13:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以看到这些被窗户圈起来的像一张明信片一样的景色\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And you watch all these places whipping by the windows like postcards.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.72,1:13:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一次很好的经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's quite an experience.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.68,1:13:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我是说 如果你这么说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, I mean, if you say so.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.00,1:13:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, it was nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.92,1:13:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.56,1:13:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么把这些都拿出来放在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How you have all this out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.84,1:13:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也可以做同样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You could have the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.60,1:13:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我不会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.52,1:13:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 不仅仅是那些闪亮的奖杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mean, not just the shiny stuff,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.88,1:14:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有更好的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but the better stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.52,1:14:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,过上更好的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Have a better life.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.56,1:14:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,做一个更好的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Be a better man.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.64,1:14:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我在想你以前说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know, I was thinking about what you were saying about.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.00,1:14:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于我最近做了什么明智的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}what smart decisions have I made lately.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.16,1:14:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不出很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Couldn't think of many.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.08,1:14:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我甚至不在那里当我的儿子的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know, I wasn't even there when my son's son,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.00,1:14:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}my grandson,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.04,1:14:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,出生的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}was born.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.32,1:14:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 他现在可能长得这么高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mean, he's like that tall now probably.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.72,1:14:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至不认识他 他也不认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't even know him. He doesn't know me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.68,1:14:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.72,1:14:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你为什么不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, why won't you just.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.04,1:14:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}call him?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.28,1:14:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并没有那么容易 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It ain't that easy, you know…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.00,1:15:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Listen,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.20,1:15:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望你犯我犯过的同样的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't want you making the same mistakes I made.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.52,1:15:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.08,1:15:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你得问问你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, you gotta ask yourself,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.04,1:15:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说珍贵的东西的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}what's the valuable stuff?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.72,1:15:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我以前问过你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's like I asked you before.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.76,1:15:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在为什么而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What were you really fighting for?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.60,1:15:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对此很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I was afraid. Of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.32,1:15:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些期望\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Expectations.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.76,1:15:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Being the champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.72,1:15:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕我做不到他做的到的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I was scared I couldn't do what he could.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.16,1:15:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.92,1:15:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前觉得他是我的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I used to feel like he was a part of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.72,1:15:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我听不见他了还有那件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now I can't hear him, or that thing,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.64,1:15:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我进入拳击场的那件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}that thing that tells me to get in the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.68,1:16:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,移动我的脚 举起我的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Move my feet, keep my hands up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.08,1:16:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,排除任何阻挡我道路的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hit anything that gets in my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.72,1:16:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也听不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I can't hear it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.52,1:16:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至不知道我是怎么失去它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't even know how I lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.80,1:16:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的想法不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your mind wasn't right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.24,1:16:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的天性不会在那么大的一个人上适用\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And your natural style just won't work with a guy that big.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.68,1:16:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说你的更好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You saying yours was better?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.52,1:16:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I won, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.24,1:16:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 叔叔 我也很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Good seeing you, Unc. Great to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.52,1:16:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你妈妈谈过话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I was talking with your mother,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.12,1:16:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说你给孩子起了这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and she says you came up with this name for the child.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.64,1:16:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿马拉 阿马拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Amara. Amara.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.00,1:17:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.28,1:17:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 这个名字怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why, what's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.36,1:17:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这个名字很漂亮 但有点复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, it's a beautiful name, but it's kind of complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.48,1:17:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不想个其他名字呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why don't you think about something,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.08,1:10:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's good?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.40,1:10:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是勉强维持生计 伙计 好久不见了 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just maintaining, man. Long time no see, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.16,1:10:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 伙计 刚刚被抓到 你知道的 关于房子孩子的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Nothing, man. Just been caught up. You know, the house, the baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.56,1:10:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是这么一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know how it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.72,1:10:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 比安卡怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah? How Bianca doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.84,1:10:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很好 她很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She's good. She's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.72,1:10:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Good, good, good.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.84,1:10:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 伙计 我一直想和你打一局\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Listen, man, I've been meaning to hit you up, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.40,1:10:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,领队想知道我们下一步要和谁打\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Commissioner wanna know who we plan to fight next.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.20,1:10:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必和德拉戈打\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You ain't gotta fight Drago,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.28,1:10:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你必须和某人战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but you gotta fight someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.00,1:10:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得保卫腰带\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You gotta defend the belt.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.68,1:10:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则 它就会空出\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Otherwise, it's gonna be vacated.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.28,1:10:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以设置一些 你知道类似调整战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I could set up a little, you know, tuneup fight, kind of.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.36,1:10:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你知道吗 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No. You know what, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.48,1:10:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在别担心这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't worry about none of that right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.68,1:11:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Listen, just come on inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.44,1:11:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,打沙包 伙计 热热身\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hit the bag, man, warm up.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.44,1:11:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.88,1:11:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我去拿我的东西 然后在那里见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, I'm gonna grab my stuff, and I'm gonna meet you in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.68,1:11:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}All right, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.44,1:11:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的身体力量放在那个手套上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Put your body weight into that glove.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.36,1:11:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 用力打它\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There you go. Lean in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.92,1:11:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我给你打过无数次电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, I called you, like, a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.80,1:11:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 关于灯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, it's about the light.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.72,1:11:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,能用多长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How long?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.96,1:11:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想具体点吗 几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You want to be specific? Couple years.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.52,1:11:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.76,1:11:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 装一个灯泡需要多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mean, how many guys does it take to screw in a light bulb?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.56,1:11:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm not joking.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.76,1:12:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能给你们回个电话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Can I call you guys back?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.80,1:12:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.60,1:12:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.88,1:12:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ma.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.72,1:13:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.68,1:13:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近怎么样 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How you doing, kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.84,1:13:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.32,1:13:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I hope you don't mind,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.68,1:13:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈问我能不能出来 因为她很担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}your mom asked if I would come out 'cause she's worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.28,1:13:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I am, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.44,1:13:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.40,1:13:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必大老远过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You didn't have to come all this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.04,1:13:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坐火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}By train.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.04,1:13:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐火车三天\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Three days on a train.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.76,1:13:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 你知道 给你时间思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's all right, you know, gives you time to think.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.20,1:13:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以看到这些被窗户圈起来的像一张明信片一样的景色\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And you watch all these places whipping by the windows like postcards.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.72,1:13:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一次很好的经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's quite an experience.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.68,1:13:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我是说 如果你这么说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, I mean, if you say so.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.00,1:13:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, it was nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.92,1:13:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.56,1:13:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么把这些都拿出来放在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How you have all this out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.84,1:13:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也可以做同样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You could have the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.60,1:13:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我不会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.52,1:13:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 不仅仅是那些闪亮的奖杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mean, not just the shiny stuff,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.88,1:14:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有更好的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but the better stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.52,1:14:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,过上更好的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Have a better life.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.56,1:14:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,做一个更好的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Be a better man.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.64,1:14:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我在想你以前说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know, I was thinking about what you were saying about.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.00,1:14:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于我最近做了什么明智的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}what smart decisions have I made lately.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.16,1:14:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不出很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Couldn't think of many.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.08,1:14:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我甚至不在那里当我的儿子的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know, I wasn't even there when my son's son,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.00,1:14:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}my grandson,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.04,1:14:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,出生的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}was born.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.32,1:14:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 他现在可能长得这么高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mean, he's like that tall now probably.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.72,1:14:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至不认识他 他也不认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't even know him. He doesn't know me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.68,1:14:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.72,1:14:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你为什么不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, why won't you just.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.04,1:14:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}call him?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.28,1:14:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并没有那么容易 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It ain't that easy, you know…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.00,1:15:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Listen,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.20,1:15:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望你犯我犯过的同样的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't want you making the same mistakes I made.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.52,1:15:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.08,1:15:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你得问问你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, you gotta ask yourself,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.04,1:15:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说珍贵的东西的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}what's the valuable stuff?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.72,1:15:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我以前问过你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's like I asked you before.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.76,1:15:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在为什么而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What were you really fighting for?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.60,1:15:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对此很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I was afraid. Of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.32,1:15:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些期望\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Expectations.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.76,1:15:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Being the champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.72,1:15:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕我做不到他做的到的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I was scared I couldn't do what he could.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.16,1:15:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.92,1:15:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前觉得他是我的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I used to feel like he was a part of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.72,1:15:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我听不见他了还有那件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now I can't hear him, or that thing,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.64,1:15:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我进入拳击场的那件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}that thing that tells me to get in the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.68,1:16:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,移动我的脚 举起我的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Move my feet, keep my hands up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.08,1:16:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,排除任何阻挡我道路的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hit anything that gets in my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.72,1:16:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也听不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I can't hear it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.52,1:16:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至不知道我是怎么失去它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't even know how I lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.80,1:16:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的想法不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your mind wasn't right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.24,1:16:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的天性不会在那么大的一个人上适用\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And your natural style just won't work with a guy that big.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.68,1:16:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说你的更好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You saying yours was better?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.52,1:16:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I won, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.24,1:16:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 叔叔 我也很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Good seeing you, Unc. Great to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.52,1:16:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你妈妈谈过话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I was talking with your mother,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.12,1:16:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说你给孩子起了这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and she says you came up with this name for the child.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.64,1:16:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿马拉 阿马拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Amara. Amara.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.00,1:17:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.28,1:17:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 这个名字怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why, what's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.36,1:17:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这个名字很漂亮 但有点复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, it's a beautiful name, but it's kind of complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.48,1:17:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不想个其他名字呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why don't you think about something,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.12,1:17:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我愿意 简单来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}at least I would, a little simpler to say,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.36,1:17:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像贝基或凯特 类似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}like "Becky" or "Cate, " something like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.72,1:17:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特 奎迪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Cate Creed?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.92,1:17:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特 奎迪 两个C 容易记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Cate Creed. Two "C's." Easy to remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.00,1:17:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道她即将是一位黑人 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You do know she's gonna be black, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.00,1:17:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对的 我都忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, that's right, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.36,1:17:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,行\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.52,1:17:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Hey, Ma. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.24,1:17:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 现在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait, right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.56,1:17:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放松 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Relax. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.04,1:17:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会顺利的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Everything's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.92,1:17:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要陪着她 好吗 这是你的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You just gotta be there for her, okay? That's your job.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.68,1:17:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I got you, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.88,1:17:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还要记住 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- And remember… - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.40,1:17:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天将是你人生中最棒的一天 就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Today is gonna be the best day of your life. Right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.00,1:17:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在吗 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- All right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.92,1:17:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最棒的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Best day of your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.20,1:17:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要有宝宝了 - 我感觉就像是我要有宝宝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- I'm having a baby. - I feel like I'm having a baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.08,1:17:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 儿子 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Boy! - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.76,1:17:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还在干什么呢 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- What you doing? - I know…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.24,1:18:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不用在意 快进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, never mind. Just get in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.52,1:18:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay. Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.80,1:18:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我说的 你需要我的时候 我就在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Like I said, I'll be here if you need me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.40,1:18:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- All right. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.52,1:18:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我会做任何我能做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know, I'm gonna do what I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.68,1:18:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿已经足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You being here is more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.88,1:18:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.38,1:18:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（164.6，96.8）}罗伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Robert.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.04,1:19:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚先生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Mr. Balboa?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.20,1:19:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 宝宝出生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Mmm. - She's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.96,1:19:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.52,1:19:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's absolutely good.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.16,1:19:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.68,1:19:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,叔 和你的教女打个招呼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, Unc, say hi to your goddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.60,1:19:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wow. That's quite an honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.64,1:19:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我看看你 - 她在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Let me see you. - Here she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.00,1:19:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好呀 小美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, hello, beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.20,1:19:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,护士 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, nurse…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.44,1:19:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有检查要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}…what about the test?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.12,1:19:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Relax for now.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.00,1:19:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将尽快做一个听力检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We'll run an auditory exam as soon as.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.33,1:19:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和阿马拉先休息一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}you and Amara get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.00,1:20:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's okay, babe.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.08,1:20:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢上帝 这孩子长得像你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Thank God she looks like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.48,1:20:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, right.
