Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.52,1:29:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不正确处理这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, I wouldn't be any good to anybody if I don't handle this the.
