Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.76,1:29:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But I need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.24,1:29:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.76,1:29:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会打败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'll beat him.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.12,1:29:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好说到做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You better.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.92,1:29:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事你得想清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You gotta think about this real hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.92,1:29:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在有需要你的人在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You got people that need you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.68,1:29:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因如此我绝不能输\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's exactly why I can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.24,1:30:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴蒂说这场比赛得在俄罗斯打\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Buddy said the fight has to be in Russia.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.08,1:30:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么接受 要么不打\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Take it or leave it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.44,1:30:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄罗斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Russia?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.84,1:30:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们的主场上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}On their turf.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.84,1:30:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就去俄罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So Russia it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.52,1:30:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗克 你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What you think, Rock?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.24,1:30:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要由裁判判决 那是他们占尽优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's a clear advantage if it comes down to a judge's decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.36,1:30:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就不能走到裁判判决那一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, then we can't let it get to a judge's decision, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.00,1:30:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.52,1:30:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,给主办方打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Call the promoter.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.20,1:30:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们明早5点动身\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So we try to hit tomorrow, 5 a.M.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.36,1:30:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我有别的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, I got other plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.56,1:30:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是说去费城吗 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- You mean, you wanna go to Philly? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.28,1:30:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你想很大程度改变现状\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Listen, you wanna change things in a big way,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.36,1:30:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就要作出很多巨大的改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}then you need to make some big changes.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.08,1:31:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会帮我训练 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You gotta be messing with me, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.56,1:32:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说这是个拳击手用来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Heard this is a place where fighters go,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.92,1:32:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的 重新来过的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}you know, to start over.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.96,1:32:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,浴火重生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Get reborn.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.44,1:32:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么花这么长时间才到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What took y'all so long?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.44,1:32:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是些很苦的训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This some wild shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.00,1:32:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我看着都觉得像地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, sure looks like hell to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.04,1:32:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你要重回地狱 提前适应比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Since you're going back to hell, you might as well get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.28,1:32:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.52,1:32:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.96,1:32:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Harder.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.20,1:32:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,再用力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Harder!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.72,1:32:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.20,1:33:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,颈部用力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Build that neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.40,1:33:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 选手上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay, man up.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.56,1:33:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.64,1:33:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.52,1:33:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是比赛形式 脚对脚 适应下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's the fight it's gonna be. Toe-to-toe. Get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.40,1:33:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,开打\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Box!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.20,1:33:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,用身体接下这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Take it to the body.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.56,1:34:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,都忍着 别输给疼痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Take it! Fight the pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.80,1:34:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.56,1:34:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚放回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Get back in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.76,1:34:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,回轮胎那儿 保护好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Get back in there. Protect yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.68,1:35:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 站起来 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, get up, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.04,1:35:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.04,1:35:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.76,1:35:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.76,1:37:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还剩下几分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We're just minutes away from the fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.56,1:37:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场举世瞩目的比赛就要开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}the whole world has been waiting to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.44,1:37:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿多尼斯·奎迪与维克托·德拉戈的再战\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The rematch between Adonis Creed and Viktor Drago.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.88,1:38:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,争夺那重量级世界冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}for the heavyweight championship of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.16,1:38:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 这场比赛的独特之处在于\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The unique thing about this fight, Jim,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.96,1:38:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿多尼斯 •奎迪处于一个25比1的劣势\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}is Adonis Creed comes in a 25-to-1 underdog,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.60,1:38:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and he's the champ!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.52,1:38:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这会很吸引人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, it's gonna be fascinating to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.36,1:38:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对奎迪进入拳台的心态有什么影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}what that does to Creed's mindset as he enters the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.80,1:38:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去提起德拉戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Not to mention Drago's.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.72,1:38:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈 德拉戈 德拉戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Drago! Drago! Drago!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.80,1:39:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And there he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.64,1:39:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 维克托•德拉戈 正在走进竞技场\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ladies and gentlemen, Viktor Drago! Making his way into the arena.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.68,1:39:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有腰带\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He does not have the belt,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.38,1:39:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是对于俄罗斯人和世界上的许多人来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but to everyone here in Russia and to many around the world,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.20,1:39:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是真正的重量级冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}he is the true heavyweight champion.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.12,1:40:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's time, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.00,1:40:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是奎迪无法逃避的一战\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There was no way Creed could have run from this fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.68,1:40:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿多尼斯是不会退出与维克托的擂台战的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There was such high demand for Adonis to step back in the ring with Viktor.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.32,1:40:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信伊万在多年后重返家乡的感觉很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And I'm sure Ivan feels good to be back home after all these years.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.52,1:41:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路走来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ Ran the whole way ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.80,1:41:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,披荆斩棘\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ Ran the whole thing ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.24,1:41:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,从不逃离\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ Never ran away ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.56,1:41:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所畏惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ Never been afraid ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.08,1:41:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不被击垮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ Never gonna break ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.40,1:41:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不半途而废\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ Never halfway ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.24,1:41:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我能否抗住\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ I don't know if I can take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.34,1:41:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,繁重压力让我再也无法忍受\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ I can take it. I can take it anymore ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.08,1:41:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道自己是否能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ I don't know if I could do it ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.22,1:41:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不知为谁拼尽全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ If it wasn't for who I'd do it for ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.88,1:41:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无道理 但是可以大赚一笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ Doesn't make sense But it makes dollars ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.60,1:41:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想所有的钱都任你花\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ And I wanna spend it all with you ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.04,1:41:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,背离世界也要与你一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ Against the world But I'm with you ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.48,1:41:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将去战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ I would go to war ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.92,1:41:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会让你失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ 'Don't let you down ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.04,1:41:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不让你失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ Won't let you down ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.16,1:41:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将迎来战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}♪ I would go to war ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.00,1:42:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住你为什么爬过那些荆棘\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Remember why you're climbing these steps.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.12,1:42:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on up, champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.32,1:42:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是吉姆 奎迪对决德拉戈的第二部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is it, Jim. Creed versus Drago part two.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.16,1:42:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪今晚看起来状态很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed looks good tonight,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.76,1:42:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是不要忘记在他身上发生过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but it's impossible to forget what happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.56,1:42:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他最后一次和德拉戈争夺冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}the last time he stepped into the ring with Drago.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.48,1:42:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,多处受伤 最严重的是 肋骨重度骨折\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Numerous injuries, not least of all, a nasty broken rib.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.32,1:42:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个破裂的肾脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and a ruptured kidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.16,1:42:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场战斗中一个巨大的差异\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}A huge difference in this fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.00,1:42:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他把前冠军洛奇•巴尔博亚请回了他这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}is he's got former champ Rocky Balboa back in his corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.00,1:42:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都相信洛奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And Rocky assures everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.72,1:42:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场战斗将十分不同于前任冠军的那场\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}this fight will be very different from its predecessor.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.16,1:42:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 大家晚上好 这里是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Good evening, ladies and gentlemen. This is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.00,1:42:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,重量级拳击世界冠军争夺战\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Twelve rounds of boxing.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.40,1:42:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,的第十二轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}for the heavyweight championship of the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.12,1:42:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.20,1:43:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们一起准备欢呼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}let's get ready to rumble!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.48,1:43:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 你能感受到竞技场今晚的紧张劲儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You can feel the nervous energy in the arena tonight, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.20,1:43:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪充满勇气的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed has some courage to get back into the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.84,1:43:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一个将结束他拳击生涯的男人站上擂台\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}with a man who nearly ended his career.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.00,1:43:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个极度渴望冠军的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}A man who is hungry to be champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.28,1:43:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,战士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Fighters,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.76,1:43:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望这是一场高质量的公正的对决\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I want good, clean fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.04,1:43:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我喊开始时开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Break when I tell you to break.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.36,1:43:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我告诉你回到场角时回到场角\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You go to your corner when I tell you to go to your corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.48,1:43:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰一下拳套\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Touch gloves.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.80,1:43:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇•巴尔博亚与伊万•德拉戈同台\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Rocky Balboa and Ivan Drago sharing the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.32,1:43:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是30年来的首次\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}for the first time in 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.40,1:43:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人知道怎么对付德拉戈这样的强敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}If anyone knows how to take on a slugger like Drago,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.81,1:43:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人一定是洛奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}it would be Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.48,1:43:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你的内脏有大问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know you got the fire in your gut,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.00,1:43:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你将完成你的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and I know you'll do what needs to be done.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.48,1:44:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为现今的状况 你知道你为何而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Because now, you know what you're fighting for.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.08,1:44:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,维克托对奎迪先前的战术感到不知所措\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Viktor overwhelmed Creed's previous game plan,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.64,1:44:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想它在阿多尼斯的脑袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and I think it got in Adonis' head.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.64,1:44:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有意思看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's gonna be interesting to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.05,1:44:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇•巴尔博亚准备如何应对奎迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}how Rocky Balboa has prepared Creed.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.68,1:44:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这肯定会是一场竭尽全力的大战\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}for what is surely to become an all-out brawl.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.76,1:44:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.64,1:44:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Box.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.96,1:44:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的比赛现在开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And we're underway.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.56,1:44:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈摇摆着打出两记勾拳但奎迪闪开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Drago comes out swinging with two hooks that Creed avoids.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.80,1:44:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个强力右拳给与还击\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And a big right-hand right out of the gate.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.96,1:44:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐尼 注意点右面\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Watch that right, Donnie.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.60,1:44:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,当奎迪挥动拳头时 德拉戈有点惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Drago a bit surprised as Creed shakes that punch off.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.60,1:44:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈正在猛攻 但奎迪没有后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Drago is pressing hard, but Creed is not backing off.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.20,1:44:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,动起来 动起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Keep moving, keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.56,1:44:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚奎迪在德拉戈身上不断击打着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed working a little bit closer to Drago tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.56,1:45:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪打出了一套凶残的组合拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That is a vicious combination by Creed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.24,1:45:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在德拉戈用有力的右拳还击\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And now a right hand by Drago.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.68,1:45:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看呐 德拉戈又开始猛攻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Here we go, Drago applying pressure.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.72,1:45:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离开场角 - 唐尼 快点离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Out the corner! - Come on, Donnie!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.40,1:45:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪设法脱身\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed manages to slip away.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.96,1:45:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们接着来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let's get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.04,1:45:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.84,1:45:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他俩在擂台中间的地方 你来我往\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now they're squaring off in the middle of the ring, toe-to-toe.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.80,1:45:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,承受打击\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Taking blows.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.12,1:45:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪一直击打他的面部\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed staying in his face.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.68,1:45:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间到 风暴般的第一轮到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And there's the bell! As a wild first round comes to an end.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.16,1:45:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到你的场角\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Go to your corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.64,1:45:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈有些泄气\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Drago frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.23,1:45:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚奎迪看起来像一个与往常不同的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed is looking like a different fighter tonight,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.99,1:45:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,竭尽全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Max.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.16,1:45:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这样 D 就是这样 - 好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- That's it, D! That's it! - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.44,1:45:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 现在谁还在喊德拉戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, yeah, who's saying Drago now, though?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.88,1:45:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 沙漠中所有的付出都得到了回报 不是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}See, all that work in the desert paid off, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.68,1:45:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你和他打 你让他明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, you got him. You got him thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.28,1:45:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有预料到你现在的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He wasn't expecting what you're bringing.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.80,1:45:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 他会带着愤怒在下一轮和你打\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now, he's gonna bring the heat the next round,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.66,1:45:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你已然有所准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but you're ready for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.40,1:45:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在超负荷的使用自己的右手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He overextends his right hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.28,1:45:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要用右手格挡\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You gonna counter with the right.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.60,1:45:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,用左手打他 明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and crack him with the left. You got that?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.32,1:45:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,向右伸拳 向左打他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Extend the right, crack him with the left.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.80,1:46:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他永远不会预料到的 他的老爸也对我做了同样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He'll never expect it. His old man did the same thing to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.40,1:46:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据早期观察 麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}One early observation, Max.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.16,1:46:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得奎迪能承受德拉戈的组合拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I think Creed is withstanding Drago's combinations.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.04,1:46:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚的比赛比第一次比赛好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}much better tonight than in the first fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.16,1:46:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Box.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.40,1:46:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二轮开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And round two begins.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.40,1:46:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈用一个强力左勾拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Drago with a huge left hook.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.84,1:46:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,和强力右拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And a big right hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.36,1:46:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈再次发起攻击 现在把奎迪逼到了围栏绳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Drago on the attack again, now driving Creed back into the ropes.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.80,1:46:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他越过了右边 注意右边\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He's overextending the right! Watch the right!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.60,1:46:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪从左右打出两拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}A right and a left for Creed.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.60,1:46:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,强力的上勾拳打中了奎迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Huge uppercut has Creed holding on now.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.40,1:46:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈把他逼到角落里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Drago throws him off into the corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.84,1:46:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离开那个角落 - 离开那个角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Get out of that corner! - Get out of the corner!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.88,1:46:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈把奎迪扔回台上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And Drago throws Creed to the canvas.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.04,1:47:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.28,1:47:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次打斗的阴影 但德拉戈这次表现出克制\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Shades of the first fight, but Drago showing restraint this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.04,1:47:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You good?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.12,1:47:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.72,1:47:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开始 - 德拉戈在休息后爆发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Box. - Drago explodes from the break.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.84,1:47:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪倒下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And Creed is down!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.20,1:47:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一阵猛烈的进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}A flurry of heavy shots!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.32,1:47:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉戈的力量真是不可思议\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Drago's power is just incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.84,1:47:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Three.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.60,1:47:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Four.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.96,1:47:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,数到八 等八数完\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Take the eight count. Take the full eight.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.40,1:47:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪仍然趴在台上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Creed taking his time on the canvas.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.80,1:47:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,六\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Six.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.04,1:47:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续趴着 呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Stay down! Breathe!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.48,1:47:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在听之前遇到过这种情况的洛基的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He's listening to Rocky, who has been in this situation before.
